classDiagram
 direction LR
class AnalysisJob {
  <<AggregateRoot>>
  -UUID id
  -UUID sessionId
  -Long userId
  -String analysisVersion
  -AnalysisState state
  -int attempts
  -Instant updatedAt
  +start() void
  +complete(SpeechAnalysisResult result) void
  +fail(String reason) void
  +retry() void
}
class AnalysisState {
  <<enumeration>>
  PENDING
  RUNNING
  COMPLETED
  FAILED
  CANCELLED
}
class FillerDetector {
  +detect(String transcript) FillerResult
}
class FillerResult {
  <<ValueObject>>
  -int totalWords
  -int totalFillers
  -Map~String,int~ byType
  -double fillerRatio
  +hasEvidence() boolean
}
AnalysisJob --> AnalysisState : estado
AnalysisJob "1" *-- "0..1" SpeechAnalysisResult : resultado
FillerDetector ..> FillerResult : calcula
class AuthorizedSpeechEvidence {
  <<ValueObject>>
  -String transcript
  -Map~String,double~ acousticFeatures
  -String authorizedContext
  -String goal
  -List~String~ focusAreas
  -int confirmedDurationSeconds
}
class SpeechAnalysisResult {
  <<ValueObject>>
  -Map~String,double~ acousticMetrics
  -List~String~ availableDimensions
  -List~String~ limitations
}
class ContextualFinding {
  <<ValueObject>>
  -String term
  -boolean spoken
  -String evidenceFragment
  -String suggestedAlternative
  -String reason
}
class AcousticEvidenceAnalyzer {
  +analyze(AuthorizedSpeechEvidence evidence) SpeechAnalysisResult
}
class ContextualEvidenceAnalyzer {
  +analyze(AuthorizedSpeechEvidence evidence) List~ContextualFinding~
}
SpeechAnalysisResult "1" *-- "1" FillerResult : muletillas
SpeechAnalysisResult "1" *-- "0..*" ContextualFinding : hallazgos contextuales
AcousticEvidenceAnalyzer ..> AuthorizedSpeechEvidence : utiliza señales disponibles
AcousticEvidenceAnalyzer ..> SpeechAnalysisResult : calcula métricas con soporte
ContextualEvidenceAnalyzer ..> AuthorizedSpeechEvidence : interpreta contexto autorizado
ContextualEvidenceAnalyzer ..> ContextualFinding : distingue uso y sugerencia
